Trade & Enchant Cycle -- a native Rust mod for Horizon.

This project contains no Minecraft code, assets or data. It is not an official
Minecraft product and is not approved by or associated with Mojang or
Microsoft. Playing it needs your own legally obtained copy of Minecraft: Java
Edition, as Horizon itself does.

It is not a Fabric, Forge, NeoForge, Bukkit or Spigot plugin, and it is not a
Horizon WebAssembly content mod. It is a Horizon *native* mod: a source-mixin
bundle (`bundle/`) that the Horizon launcher applies to Horizon's own Rust
source and compiles into the game.

The villager and enchanting rules it calls are Horizon's own port of vanilla's
`AbstractVillager` / `trade_set` generation and `EnchantmentMenu` offer
generation. This project does not re-implement or replace them; it reuses them
and only decides when to roll again.

